            "detailed_description": "Mob Stadium holds the secret to escaping the end of all time! Traps, challenges, and a Grand Finale await your demise in this challenging shooter made for the HTC Vive.<br><br>As the brown dwarf Wormwood returns, the Anunnaki have emerged from the aether to test humankind.  Armed with a small pistol and trapped in a terrestrial Anunnaki compound, can you survive long enough to decipher the mysteries of Mob Stadium?  <br><br><br>Features:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Smooth track-pad based locomotion*<br></li><li>Fast action gun-play<br></li><li>Puzzle solving<br></li><li>Maze-like map progression</li></ul><br><br><i>*Smooth movement can cause VR motion sickness<br>*HTC Vive and SteamVR required</i>",
