                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I Purchased this Game while on Sale...$4.49 figured, lets check it out! \n \nThings I like: \n         - You can move around via Touch Pad Locomotion\n         - You get a Gun and it Works!\n         \n Things I Dislike: \n        - You can't Run or Jump\n        - Once You run out of ammo there is No way to defend yourself...? Game Over...  \n  Overall: \n        - I had Fun Playing the Game. It isn't the worse. but yet, it isn't the best! But, for under $5 bucks you should put it to \n  the Test!",
